<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Let Your north wind blow on me,</l><l>Let Your Spirit surround me</l><l>’Til my being is open, trusting You once again.</l><l>Then burn and consume me</l><l>With Your jealous God’s fire</l><l>’Til me being is obedient,</l><l>’Til my soul You have gained.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I will turn my heart to You;</l><l>Seal and pledge Yourself in me.</l><l>Mingle with me completely</l><l>Like the fire in the flame;</l><l>Til my being is glowing;</l><l>Your workmanship showing;</l><l>I will turn my heart to You</l><l>Again and again.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
